<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-MBIA, Royal Bank of Canada upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-MBIA, Royal Bank of Canada upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it upgraded both MBIA Inc and Royal Bank of Canada to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- shares of MBIA, a municipal bond insurer, rose two to 117-1/16.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Royal Bank of Canada rose C$0.45 to C$66.45 in early trading.</p>
